  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "lfo_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -364
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "LFOs animate things\n\nAn LFO cycles a value between `min` and `max`, `rate` times a second.\n\n• Bars: one LFO with `count` 12 outputs 12 copies, each a little later in the cycle, so the heights ripple. The ForEach draws one bar per copy.\n• Colour: a slow triangle LFO sweeps the hue.\n• Dot: a smooth-random LFO wanders the position.\n\nTry other shapes, or wire a Bang into `reset`.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 300
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "LFOs animate things\n\nAn LFO cycles a value between `min` and `max`, `rate` times a second.\n\n• Bars: one LFO with `count` 12 outputs 12 copies, each a little later in the cycle, so the heights ripple. The ForEach draws one bar per copy.\n• Colour: a slow triangle LFO sweeps the hue.\n• Dot: a smooth-random LFO wanders the position.\n\nTry other shapes, or wire a Bang into `reset`.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
